  message: "Completed real-world repo validation per human instructions. Cloned all 3 repos to ~/ALL_REPOS/:\n- tlaplus/examples (shallow, 319 .tla files)\n- ongardie/raft.tla (shallow, 2 .tla files)\n- cockroachdb/cockroach (sparse checkout docs/tla-plus/, 2 .tla files)\n\nResults: All 3 repos pass validation. hypergumbo run completes without error on all. Node/edge counts are healthy: examples=6062 nodes/12136 edges, raft=66/204, cockroach=122/122. EXTENDS evidence_type works (665+4+8=677 total). INSTANCE works (100 in examples; 0 in raft and cockroach is correct — confirmed no INSTANCE in source). All construct types detected (operators, constants, modules, theorems, assumptions).\n\nOne bug found: TLA+ missing from profile.languages (sketch Overview line doesn't show TLA+). Filed as separate tracker item. Full results in ~/hypergumbo_lab_notebook/tla_realworld_validation_04092026.md."  # 0a62
